@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 4: Bidding & Proposal Management

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Worker
actor Customer
actor Administrator as Admin
actor "Realtime Notification Service" as Realtime

rectangle "Serviqo Bidding & Proposal Management" {
  usecase "Submit a bid on an\nopen job" as SubmitBid
  usecase "Provide bid amount,\nproposal and estimated days" as ProvideProposal
  usecase "View own submitted bids\nand their statuses" as ViewOwnBids

  usecase "Review bids for\ncustomer's job" as ReviewBids
  usecase "View proposal, price,\ntimeline and worker details" as CompareBids
  usecase "Accept a pending bid" as AcceptBid
  usecase "Reject a pending bid" as RejectBid
  usecase "Assign worker and set job active" as AssignWorker
  usecase "Reject other bids for\nthe accepted job" as CloseOtherBids

  usecase "View bids for a job" as AdminViewBids
  usecase "Notify users of bid\nsubmission or decision" as NotifyUsers
}

Worker -- SubmitBid
Worker -- ViewOwnBids
Customer -- ReviewBids
Admin -- AdminViewBids

SubmitBid ..> ProvideProposal : <<include>>
SubmitBid ..> NotifyUsers : <<include>>
ViewOwnBids ..> NotifyUsers : <<extend>>

ReviewBids ..> CompareBids : <<include>>
AcceptBid ..> ReviewBids : <<extend>>
RejectBid ..> ReviewBids : <<extend>>
AcceptBid ..> AssignWorker : <<include>>
AcceptBid ..> CloseOtherBids : <<include>>
AcceptBid ..> NotifyUsers : <<include>>
RejectBid ..> NotifyUsers : <<include>>
NotifyUsers -- Realtime

note right of SubmitBid
Only active, platform-verified workers
can bid. The job must be open, workers
cannot bid on their own job, and each
worker may submit only one bid per job.
end note

note right of ReviewBids
Only the customer who owns the job can
review, accept, or reject its bids.
Only pending bids may be decided.
end note

note bottom of AcceptBid
Accepting a bid assigns its worker,
changes the job to active, and changes
the other bids for that job to rejected.
end note

note right of AdminViewBids
Admins may view bids through the
admin-authorized bid lookup route.
They cannot submit, accept, or reject bids.
end note

@enduml
